stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Bound
    Bound --> Busy : existing active or native Running selection
    Busy --> NativeQueue : existing busy paste + Enter and receipt
    Bound --> Evidence : Idle first-input selection
    Evidence --> Evidence : stale source / soft summary / continuation pending
    Evidence --> DraftAdmission : current SessionStart or approved terminal Idle
    DraftAdmission --> TypedHeld : existing composer veto before first key
    TypedHeld --> Evidence : same NotSentProof / hold_not_sent / wake
    DraftAdmission --> FirstKey : current proof and latch revision; existing writer gate
    FirstKey --> Receipt : existing payload and Enter
    Receipt --> Done : exact original receipt
    Receipt --> RetainedUnknown : existing crash contract
    Bound --> ReverseExit : existing reverse return path; outside this refinement
